See also: ‘df_bind_rows’, ‘df_inner_join’ ## DuckDB Integration

The ‘dataframes-duckdb’ extension adds file I/O, SQL queries, and
DuckDB-accelerated operations to the dataframes package.  It requires
‘libduckdb’ (‘brew install duckdb’ on macOS).

load("dataframes-duckdb")$

*Type mapping:* DuckDB DOUBLE → ndarray (f64), INTEGER/BIGINT → ndarray
(coerced to f64), VARCHAR → string-column, NULL → NaN (numeric) or “”
(string).


